    "visualVerification": "Compared arrows and per-lane actions in 2017 printed p. 78 / PDF p. 79 and 2014 printed p. 50 / PDF p. 50. The source drawing shows Anne at 3/4-beat intervals and Ben at one-beat intervals, repeating on six beats. Pass endpoints by source lane index: Anne 0→Ben 1, 2→Ben 2, 4→Ben 3, 6→Ben 5; Ben 0→Anne 1, 1→Anne 2, 3→Anne 4, 4→Anne 6. Self throws connect to the next same-lane event. The printed action rows establish which sources are passes/self; the arrows establish each receiving event.",
